# WarriorTeleportBombAggressive (22133, level 78): seeing the character it jumps onto it and wants its
# teleport effect (4671) on itself, and attacks no one. The effect's landing arms the 5 s
# timer 1001, whose draw of 100 picks the blast: under 33 the first (4614), under 66 the second
# (4489), else the third (4488); the blast's landing kills it. Here the draw is 70, the blast 4488-10.
character Hunter 20
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.WarriorBase
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.Warrior
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.WarriorBomb
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.WarriorTeleportBombAggressive
npc bomb 22133 Monster 300 0 0 level 78 skill SELF_RANGE_DD_MAGIC 4614 8 skill SELF_RANGE_DD_MAGIC2 4489 10 skill SELF_RANGE_DD_MAGIC3 4488 10 skill TELEPORT_EFFECT 4671 1
roll bomb 0

tick x2
  S DeleteObject obj=bomb
  S MagicSkillUse caster=bomb target=bomb skill=4671-1 hit=0 reuse=0 success=0
  at bomb 0 0 0
  mem bomb i_ai1=1
  hate bomb 0
advance 6s
  random 70
  desires bomb cast(bomb,4488,move)=1000000
tick x2
  S MagicSkillUse caster=bomb target=bomb skill=4488-10 hit=0 reuse=0 success=0
  S SystemMessage id=110 4:4488,10
advance 2s
  dead bomb yes
